| SageMaker | `SageMakerCategoryService.predict` calls `invoke_endpoint` and requires JSON `category`, `predicted_label`, or `label`. | Not connected. No training script, model artifact, or endpoint. Default is a keyword scorer in `LocalCategoryService`. |
| SQS | `AwsNotifier.listing_published` sends `{job: process-image, listing_id, image_key, owner_id}` when a photo exists. | Not connected. |
| SNS | Same method publishes `listing.published`. The Lambda can publish a second message after processing. | Not connected. |
| Lambda | `handler` in `backend/lambda/image_processor/handler.py` reads S3, writes `processed/{listing_id}.jpg`, updates DynamoDB, and returns `batchItemFailures`. | Not deployed. No event-source mapping, so the DLQ behavior described in the docstring is not configured. |
